-Concise Binary Object Representation (CBOR) Library
----------------------------------------------------
+TinyCBOR 7.1 - selected QtCore source integration
+------------------------------------------------
 
-To build TinyCBOR:
+Original source: https://github.com/intel/tinycbor/tree/v7.1
+License: MIT; see LICENSE and the retained original source archive.
 
-  make
+QtCore builds the selected encoder/parser/error sources as C++, with its
+custom reader/writer callbacks. The standalone upstream project uses CMake;
+this selected copy is built through Qt's existing Core build configuration.
 
-If you want to change the compiler or pass extra compiler flags:
-
-  make CC=clang CFLAGS="-m32 -Oz" LDFLAGS="-m32"
-
-Documentation: https://intel.github.io/tinycbor/current/
-
+Qt-owned tinycbor-export.h and tinycbor-version.h are retained unchanged.
+Their export/inlining definitions and zero-valued internal version sentinel
+are Qt integration details, not the upstream TinyCBOR release identity.
+The original Qt pre-C23 unreachable() adaptation is included upstream in7.1;
+the original patch descriptor is historical and must not be reapplied.
